flowchart TD
  V["A visiting representative<br/>for its owner"]

  V --> W["1. Looks at the website:<br/>ordinary public pages,<br/>outside Shōkai"]

  W --> F["2. Looks at the agent front:<br/>listing and lobby,<br/>who it is and what it offers.<br/>Nothing asked, nothing kept"]

  F --> X["Existing pieces may be<br/>linked as hints:<br/>schema.org, product feed,<br/>MCP Server Card, A2A Agent Card"]

  X --> D["3. For anything personal,<br/>it visits the door:<br/>owner-signed visitor card,<br/>an introduction only if required,<br/>signed limits"]

  D --> S["The door answers<br/>grant, conditional,<br/>deny, or considering,<br/>and may give a pass"]

  classDef shokai fill:#2c4a6c,stroke:#2c4a6c,color:#fbf9f4
  classDef outside fill:#f5f1e8,stroke:#c7bdab,color:#4a4741
  class F,D shokai
  class W,X outside
